[
  {
    "function_name": "t",
    "kind": "translation",
    "line": 5112,
    "section": "tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/gunslinging.lua",
    "source": "Your cunning and dexterity allow you to fire incredible trick shots that can hit multiple targets.\n\t\tYou precisely aim your trick shot to ricochet amongst foes you can see so that whenever it hits something solid (creature or solid wall), it will bounce towards the next closest foe.\n\t\tIt may ricochet up to %d times (or until it misses) within range 5 of your first target and will not target the same foe twice.\n\t\tYour shot deals %d%% weapon damage on its first strike, but loses %d%% damage and %d(%d%%) accuracy with each bounce.",
    "source_tag": "tformat",
    "target": "你的灵敏让你能射出同时击中多个敌人的子弹。\n\t\t你精确地瞄准敌人，子弹命中后将弹射至其他目标上。\n\t\t子弹最多弹射 %d 次，只能在第一个目标周围 5 码范围内弹射，不会命中同一个目标两次。\n\t\t第一次命中将造成 %d%% 武器伤害，之后每次弹射下降 %d%% 伤害和 %d （%d%%）命中。",
    "args_order": null,
    "special": null,
    "logical_path": "tome-orcs.lua",
    "component": "orcs",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "events": [
      {
        "commit": "e24e2616d29339f4195c938eae3f2ab6b74b6f4f",
        "change": "modified",
        "fields": [
          "target"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "baseline_target": "你的灵敏让你能射出同时击中多个敌人的子弹。\n\t\t你精确地瞄准敌人，子弹命中后将弹射至其他目标上。\n\t\t子弹最多弹射 %d 次，只能在第一个目标周围 5 码范围内弹射，不会命中同一个目标两次。\n\t\t第一次命中将造成 %d%% 武器伤害，之后每次弹射下降 %d%% 伤害和 %d （ %d%% ）命中。",
    "net_changed": true,
