  {
    "function_name": "t",
    "kind": "translation",
    "line": 5143,
    "section": "tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/heavy-weapons.lua",
    "source": "You replace your steamgun and attack with an incendiary device that projects streams of liquid flame at your foes.\n\t\t\n\t\tDeals %d%% steamgun damage as fire over 3 turns to enemies in radius 5.\n\n\t\tThese attacks cannot miss and ignore armor.",
    "source_tag": "tformat",
    "target": "你将你的蒸汽枪替换成一把强大的蒸汽动力的喷火器，将你的敌人化为灰烬。\n\n\t\t在 5 码范围内，在 3 回合内造成 %d%% 火焰蒸汽枪伤害。\n\n\t\t这一攻击必定命中目标，无视护甲。",
    "args_order": null,
    "special": null,
    "logical_path": "tome-orcs.lua",
    "component": "orcs",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "events": [
      {
        "commit": "1bad3fe119c121f55bf4ec0ed483c9ed569624d5",
        "change": "modified",
        "fields": [
          "target"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "baseline_target": "你将你的蒸汽枪替换成一把强大的蒸汽动力的喷火器，将你的敌人化为灰烬。\n\t\t\n\t\t在 5 码范围内，在 3 回合内造成 %d%% 火焰蒸汽枪伤害。\n\n\t\t这一攻击必定命中目标，无视护甲。",
    "net_changed": true,
    "audit_id": "entry-03934",
