  },
  {
    "function_name": "t",
    "kind": "translation",
    "line": 5158,
    "section": "tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/heavy-weapons.lua",
    "source": "You replace your steamgun and attack with a lightning-charged staff to engage in close combat.\n\t\t\n\t\tDeals %d%% steamgun damage as lightning to enemies in a frontal arc, as well as reducing the damage they deal by %d%% for 3 turns. This counts as a melee attack but triggers ammunition on-hit effects. All shockstaff attacks will also make a shield slam for the same damage as lightning. \n\n\t\tYou can charge up to your steamgun's range to make shockstaff attacks.",
    "source_tag": "tformat",
    "target": "你将你的蒸汽枪替换成一根通了强电的电棍，用于进行近战格斗。\n\n\t\t在前方造成 %d%% 闪电蒸汽枪伤害，并降低他们所造成的伤害 %d%%，持续 3 回合。这一效果视作近战攻击，但可以触发弹药的命中效果。所有电击棒伤害也会附加一次盾牌攻击，造成同样的闪电伤害。\n\n\t\t你可以冲刺进行电击棒攻击，冲刺范围等于蒸汽枪射程。",
    "args_order": null,
    "special": null,
    "logical_path": "tome-orcs.lua",
    "component": "orcs",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "events": [
      {
        "commit": "1bad3fe119c121f55bf4ec0ed483c9ed569624d5",
        "change": "modified",
        "fields": [
          "target"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "baseline_target": "你将你的蒸汽枪替换成一根通了强电的电棍，用于进行近战格斗。\n\t\t\n\t\t在前方造成 %d%% 闪电蒸汽枪伤害，并降低他们所造成的伤害 %d%%，持续 3 回合。这一效果视作近战攻击，但可以触发弹药的命中效果。所有电击棒伤害也会附加一次盾牌攻击，造成同样的闪电伤害。\n\t\t\n\t\t你可以冲刺进行电击棒攻击，冲刺范围等于蒸汽枪射程。",
