  {
    "function_name": "t",
    "kind": "translation",
    "line": 5374,
    "section": "tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/mechstar.lua",
    "source": "When you fire your metalstar, your also establish a psionic bloodlink with the shrapnel still inside for %d turns.\n\t\tEach turn the victims are drained for %0.2f physical damage, half of which heals you (each additional victim healing is reduced by half).\n\t\tIf the victim move more than twice away from the radius of Metalstar (currently %d) the effect stops.\n\t\tThis damage does not break daze and increases with your Steampower.",
    "source_tag": "tformat",
    "target": "每次你使用灵晶射击时，你将与灵晶碎片建立血液灵能联系，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t每回合目标将受到 %0.2f 物理伤害，一半伤害值将转化为治疗。\n\t\t每增加一名额外目标，其带来的治疗量进一步减半。\n\t\t当目标距离超过金属灵晶范围（当前 %d）的两倍时，效果中止。\n\t\t该伤害不会打断眩晕效果，受蒸汽强度加成。",
